<< /A 62 0 R /Alt (Diagram of a deep learning model for image processing using convolutional layers, attention modules, concatenation, upsampling, and feature extraction, beginning with a plant image and outputting three feature maps at different resolutions.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 47 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
23 0 obj
<< /A 63 0 R /Alt (Panel a shows a white flower partially obscured by green pepper plant leaves in a shaded greenhouse setting. Panel b presents a close-up of a white pepper flower with large surrounding green leaves. Panel c displays a white flower and developing pepper fruit on a vertical stem with soil visible below. Panel d features a detailed view of a white pepper flower with six petals against green foliage. Panel e captures a white pepper flower among green leaves in a greenhouse environment. Panel f depicts a white pepper flower under a green stem with surrounding large green leaves.) /K 1 /P 8 0 R /Pg 47 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
