<< /A 64 0 R /Alt (Six labeled images \(a to f\) display a small yellow flower on a leafy green plant from different angles and distances; some images are rotated or zoomed, highlighting varied views and focus levels of the same flower.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 48 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
