25 0 obj
<< /A 65 0 R /Alt (Two side-by-side line charts labeled a and b show machine learning training metrics over 1,000 steps. Chart a plots box loss for training \(grey and red lines\) and validation \(light blue and dark blue lines\), demonstrating both original and smoothed loss values that decrease over time. Chart b plots mAP50 \(grey\) with a red smoothing line, showing a general increase over time, indicating improving model performance.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 49 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
26 0 obj
<< /A 66 0 R /Alt (Line chart comparing mAP50 percentage across five trials for Baseline \(blue circles, solid line\) and Ours \(green squares, solid line\), with dashed lines indicating average and standard deviation for each. Ours consistently outperforms Baseline. Legend details: Baseline w/ CIoU: 77.3 | 1.09/std, Ours: 84.82 | 0.598/std.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 50 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
